  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Introduction to J-Rap and Its Influence</h2>\n<p>J-Rap, a subgenre of Japanese hip-hop, has grown significantly over the years, influencing both local and international audiences. It is known for its unique blend of English and Japanese lyrics, energetic beats, and deep cultural roots. Artists like R.I.P. SLIME and PESU-SANG have played a crucial role in popularizing the genre, bringing it to the forefront of the Japanese music scene.</p>\n<p>The genre has also inspired a new generation of artists, including young rappers who have found their voice through J-Rap. This connection between artists and fans is a powerful force that continues to shape the music industry in Japan.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dN7gTC10XLE</p>",
